{
  "schema": 1,
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "domain": "palworld",
  "name": "Palworld",
  "platform": "proton",
  "engine": "deployment",
  "family": {
    "kind": "unreal",
    "project": "Pal"
  },
  "executable": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/Palworld-Win64-Shipping.exe",
  "launch_executable": "Palworld.exe",
  "required": [
    "Palworld.exe",
    "Pal/Binaries/Win64/Palworld-Win64-Shipping.exe"
  ],
  "header": [
    77,
    90
  ],
  "steam_id": "1623730",
  "destinations": [
    "Pal/Content/Paks/~mods",
    "Pal/Content/Paks/LogicMods",
    "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss",
    "Pal/Binaries/Win64/Mods"
  ],
  "allowed_files": [
    "Pal/Binaries/Win64/dwmapi.dll"
  ],
  "routes": [
    {
      "kind": "file",
      "source": "dwmapi.dll",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/dwmapi.dll"
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "ue4ss/",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "LogicMods/",
      "target": "Pal/Content/Paks/LogicMods/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "extension",
      "extension": ".pak",
      "root_only": true,
      "target": "Pal/Content/Paks/~mods/"
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "Pal/Content/Paks/~mods/",
      "target": "Pal/Content/Paks/~mods/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "Pal/Content/Paks/LogicMods/",
      "target": "Pal/Content/Paks/LogicMods/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "file",
      "source": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/dwmapi.dll",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/dwmapi.dll",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/Mods/",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "prefix",
      "source": "Mods/",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/",
      "search": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "manifest",
      "marker": "Scripts/main.lua",
      "target": "Pal/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Scripts UE4SS com estrutura explícita, Mods/ ou pasta identificada por Scripts/main.lua; pacotes mistos preservam Lua, ativação e LogicMods. O destino acompanha o loader instalado: Win64/Mods no layout plano ou Win64/ue4ss/Mods no layout aninhado. Dois loaders simultâneos exigem resolver a ambiguidade antes da instalação.",
    "A lista mods.txt preserva entradas externas ao perfil. A estrutura reconhecida não garante compatibilidade com a versão do jogo ou do UE4SS.",
    "Como a extensão oficial do Vortex: sem o UE4SS, as verificações oferecem baixar o UE4SS-Palworld.zip mais recente de Okaetsu/RE-UE4SS (sem a build _zDev). O UnrealPakTool que a extensão também baixa não foi reproduzido."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "https://www.nexusmods.com/palworld/mods/577",
    "https://github.com/Nexus-Mods/game-palworld",
    "https://docs.ue4ss.com/",
    "https://github.com/Nexus-Mods/game-palworld/blob/16850505152c67b0a4322a4c1ae4cdb5fd69d9e5/src/index.ts",
    "https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/770"
  ],
  "rejected_prefixes": [
    "Pal/Binaries/WinGDK/"
  ],
  "downloads": [
    {
      "name": "UE4SS",
      "repository": "Okaetsu/RE-UE4SS",
      "prefix": "UE4SS-Palworld",
      "exclude": [
        "_zDev"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
